akeholder pressure.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Able to simplify complex financial products into usable journeys.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in fintech, insurance, payments, consumer apps or regulated products is a strong advantage.</p></li></ul><h2><br /><strong>The Kind of Builder We Want</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Can set direction and still go deep into details.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Pushes teams to move faster without lowering product quality.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Knows when to simplify, when to scale and when to say no.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Can lead through clarity, not bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Avoids false claims and understands that product impact usually comes from many iterations and teams.</p></li></ul><h2><br /><strong>This Role Is Not For</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Product leaders who only manage people and meetings.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">People who cannot go deep into product details.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Candidates who are too slow for a high-growth environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Leaders who push vanity metrics without understanding real user impact.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">People who need large teams before they can create progress.</p></li></ul><h2><br /><strong>Location</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role is remote, but candidates must be based in <strong>Germany</strong>. We are hiring specifically for this market, so applicants should already be based in <strong>Germany</strong>.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Language</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">English is our main working language across global teams. Strong English communication is required.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top