sk were identified early</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have found and qualified upsell opportunities inside your existing customers, and converted a good number of them</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Customers come to you first, on their compliance programme and on their commercial relationship with us</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You can demonstrate real knowledge of our product and of the wider industry</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you will be doing:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Owning the post-sales journey for your customers: onboarding, adoption, business reviews, renewal and upsell</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Running your own renewals and upsells, including pricing and the conversation with the economic buyer</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Guiding customers through their Travel Rule programmes and their stablecoin payment products</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Working directly with customer integration teams: API documentation, test calls, transaction and webhook data, and a clear diagnosis when something is stuck</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Monitoring usage, engagement and risk signals, and acting on them with a clear plan well before they become a renewal problem</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Finding growth inside your existing customers across adjacent teams, entities and products, and working with Sales on the net-new ones</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Building relationships across compliance, operations and engineering, so the relationship never rests on one contact</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bringing customer and competitor insight back to product, sales and marketing</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Keeping records current in HubSpot</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Some on-call duty outside office hours</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you br