ation techniques such as: Assisted GNSS (A-GNSS), Hybrid positioning (GNSS + Wi-Fi/Bluetooth/IMU), LEO-PNT and emerging navigation paradigms<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW28944410 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW28944410 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Oversee implementation of GNSS algorithms in embedded C on RTOS / bare-metal systems, FPGA with focus on performance optimization, high-volume silicon deployment<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW28944410 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW28944410 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Mentor and guide engineers, contractors in GNSS algorithms and embedded development. Set technical direction and promote engineering best practices, design standards and lead technical reviews, architecture discussions, decision-making processes.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW28944410 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW28944410 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Cross-Functional collaboration with product management to shape feature roadmap and differentiation strategy. Present technical concepts and results to internal and external stakeholders, including leadership teams and customers.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Job requirements</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW259387030 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;"><strong>Must haves</strong><span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW259387030 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Qualinx is looking for a result-driven and conscientious GNSS Engineer. Someone who thrives in an environment where your proactive and can-do attitude is highly appreciated. The ideal candidate for this role must have:<span style="background-color:#C6C6